Why This Matters
Multi-cluster application deployment is crucial for modern enterprise environments because it:

Ensures High Availability: Applications can continue running even if one cluster fails
Enables Geographic Distribution: Applications can be deployed closer to users for better performance
Supports Environment Isolation: Production and non-production workloads can be completely separated
Facilitates Compliance: Different clusters can meet different regulatory requirements
Reduces Risk: Changes can be tested in staging environments before production deployment
